                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "15164390",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197997878936",
                            "num_reviews": 2,
                            "playtime_forever": 93,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 49,
                            "last_played": 1606328566
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm really enjoying this game.  It's a game that I'm finding is fun both if you only have a few minutes to kill or if you have time to really try to go through to the end.  I like the visual style of the game, it's very colorful with nicely animated characters.  The controls for character movement are really precise.\n\nI think that if you like older arcade games like the original Gauntlet then you'll have fun with this game.  As far as the price goes, for me I think it's worth the price.  It has the feel of an old school arcade game that I would have dropped more than six dollars in quarters in.\n\nThe only con for me is that I wish the controls could be remapped.  When using an xbox controller, I wish the attacks could be mapped to the second stick instead of the buttons.  Also I have an arcade controller that I think would be great for this game if I could set the controls to use it.  Keyboard/mouse are fine as is if that's what you want to use.",
